1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,350
Above the chart is a one-click Buy and Sell strip for the instrument you are viewing.

2
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:10,570
Sell shows the price you sell at. Buy shows the price you buy at.

3
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:14,470
Set the size in the middle, or use the arrows.

4
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:20,440
One click on Buy places the order straight away, so check the size first.

5
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:24,300
The trade is open, at the size you set.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,800
It is drawn on the chart too.

